# Website context

Read `AGENTS.md` before work. This repo owns the Spring application and UI. Keep host
boundaries explicit, use Flyway for schema changes, and run `./mvnw test`. VM operations
belong to `personal-ai-infra`; use the checked-in deployment script rather than ad hoc copies.
Never put secrets in source, commands, logs, or chat output.
On the Oracle VM, read `deploy/status-on-vm.sh` before changing runtime state. Work on a
`codex/*` branch in `/home/ubuntu/workspaces/personal-website-handler`, use the expiring
preview, and deploy only committed code. Record and verify every release through the
checked-in scripts; never modify `/opt/website-handler` by hand.
